cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the paper below."
title: "Lift-constrained trailing-edge noise control of a wing section"
abstract: >-
  Code and data for a study of how much trailing-edge self-noise a two-segment
  wing section can shed while holding the lift the flight condition demands,
  answered in resolved flow rather than through a semi-empirical chain, together
  with a constraint-control framework that holds lift to a prescribed band.
